{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ta-Miu is a narrative action-adventure game with elements of exploration, environmental puzzles,  and platforming, set in a stylized world of ancient Egypt. Players take on the role of a cat named Ta-Miu, chosen by the goddess Bastet to save the Pharaoh and restore balance between the world of the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse environments \u2014 from palaces and temples to deserts, oases, and underground tombs \u2014 all from a unique feline perspective. Thanks to her agility and supernatural powers, Ta-Miu overcomes obstacles, uncovers secrets, and solves puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology. She climbs, balances, sneaks through dark corridors, and uses abilities such as spirit vision, time-slowing, and illusion creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in a fully three-dimensional world rooted in historical ancient Egypt \u2014 vibrant, colorful, and rich in detail. Cities, villages, and temples reflect the era's reality, while the Nile, dividing the realms of the living and the dead, guides the rhythm of your journey. Mythology is not merely a backdrop \u2014 gods such as Thoth, Isis, Hapi, and Osiris play key roles in both narrative and mechanics, supporting the heroine throughout her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character progression system allows players to unlock magical abilities and upgrades that enhance exploration and interaction. Gameplay features encounters with humans, gods, animals, and spirits \u2014 as well as a mysterious and loyal companion who aids Ta-Miu in puzzles and story progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main storyline focuses on lifting a deadly curse from the Pharaoh and confronting the god Seth, but players can also engage in side quests and emotional micro-adventures that deepen immersion and character bonds. The game also includes minigames such as ancient Egyptian Senet, a trading system, and a lore-rich in-game encyclopedia revealing authentic facts from Egyptology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanically and emotionally balanced, <i>Ta-Miu</i> is a game for fans of contemplative adventures, exploration, and rich mythology \u2014 crafted by an Egyptologist with great respect for historical sources and artistic authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/e3cdcedc3a42c95407da501a7b18e9e7.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/e3cdcedc3a42c95407da501a7b18e9e7.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/e3cdcedc3a42c95407da501a7b18e9e7.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825470?t=1753868375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/24e5db46fb2cbeb0affd939b0a626d2a45a65346/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753868375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/661c52a2eccf524f1c66e0737cad23708bb7312b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753868375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/661c52a2eccf524f1c66e0737cad23708bb7312b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753868375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8b82d6482f7e332c9c1c5cf025ea28.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ta-Miu is a narrative action-adventure game with elements of exploration, environmental puzzles,  and platforming, set in a stylized world of ancient Egypt. Players take on the role of a cat named Ta-Miu, chosen by the goddess Bastet to save the Pharaoh and restore balance between the world of the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6f79a8010c093cdbc1c2cc05faca933f.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse environments \u2014 from palaces and temples to deserts, oases, and underground tombs \u2014 all from a unique feline perspective. Thanks to her agility and supernatural powers, Ta-Miu overcomes obstacles, uncovers secrets, and solves puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology. She climbs, balances, sneaks through dark corridors, and uses abilities such as spirit vision, time-slowing, and illusion creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/4d07fe269c10c841e18eb3d6d891bb8f.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in a fully three-dimensional world rooted in historical ancient Egypt \u2014 vibrant, colorful, and rich in detail. Cities, villages, and temples reflect the era's reality, while the Nile, dividing the realms of the living and the dead, guides the rhythm of your journey. Mythology is not merely a backdrop \u2014 gods such as Thoth, Isis, Hapi, and Osiris play key roles in both narrative and mechanics, supporting the heroine throughout her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/8e8ae76a8e1afbc0492cb5a4ef3fb6da.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character progression system allows players to unlock magical abilities and upgrades that enhance exploration and interaction. Gameplay features encounters with humans, gods, animals, and spirits \u2014 as well as a mysterious and loyal companion who aids Ta-Miu in puzzles and story progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/0f991a4703baa1e4319048a9bd3429ec.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main storyline focuses on lifting a deadly curse from the Pharaoh and confronting the god Seth, but players can also engage in side quests and emotional micro-adventures that deepen immersion and character bonds. The game also includes minigames such as ancient Egyptian Senet, a trading system, and a lore-rich in-game encyclopedia revealing authentic facts from Egyptology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.webm?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6fea1c51ed9a9fb86842081affc47140.mp4?t=1753868375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanically and emotionally balanced, <i>Ta-Miu</i> is a game for fans of contemplative adventures, exploration, and rich mythology \u2014 crafted by an Egyptologist with great respect for historical sources and artistic authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/e3cdcedc3a42c95407da501a7b18e9e7.poster.avif?t=1753868375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap